Firmware and factory data
-------------------------

Qualcomm, Xiaomi and Cirrus firmware remain subject to their respective
licenses. Inclusion in a download bundle does not place firmware under MIT.
Redistribution permissions and notices must be established for each distributed
firmware set before publication.

Device-specific calibration, WLAN and Bluetooth addresses and factory sensor
registry data are read from the user's tablet. They are not public source or
shared firmware assets and must not be distributed.
